t argument corresponds to the `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`TaskRunContext`}),`, which stores task run metadata. For example,\nthis object has attributes `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`task_run_id`}),`, `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`flow_run_id`}),`, and `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`task`}),`, all of which can be used in your\ncustom logic.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`The second argument corresponds to a dictionary of input values to the task. For example,\nif your task has the signature `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`fn(x, y, z)`}),` then the dictionary will have keys “x”, “y”, and “z” with corresponding values that can be used to compute your cache key.`]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`This function can then be specified using the `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`cache_key_fn`}),` argument on\nthe `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://reference.prefect.io/prefect/tasks/#prefect.tasks.task`,children:`task decorator`}),`.`]}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`For example:`}),`\n`,_jsx(CodeBlock,{filename:``,numberOfLines:`11`,language:`python`,children:_jsx(_components.pre,{className:`shiki shiki-themes github-light-default dark-plus`,style:{backgroundColor:`#ffffff`,\"--shiki-dark-bg\":`#0B0C0E`,color:`#1f2328`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#D4D4D4`},language:`python`,children:_jsxs(_components.code,{language:`python`,numberOfLines:`11`,children:[_jsxs(_components.span,{className:`line`,children:[_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#CF222E`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#C586C0`},children:`from`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#1F2328`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#D4D4D4`},children:` prefect `}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#CF222E`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#C586C0`},children:`import`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#1F2328`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#D4D4D4`},children:` task`})]}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.span,{className:`line`}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.span,{className:`line`}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.span,{className:`line`,children:[_jsx(_c